This is in a loop `for(i = 0; i < num_neg_pics; i++)`. If `num_neg_pics > MAX_DPB_SIZE`, then `u4_num_st_curr_before` could exceed `MAX_DPB_SIZE - 1`, causing a stack buffer overflow.

